{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"31a16436205b3c5242c40bf5120468163b82a67fc0efbc577ec08469ad12b3be","slug":"example","location":"/chapters/basics/example.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"一个简单的例子","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Henry Schreiner","given":"Henry","family":"Schreiner"},"name":"Henry Schreiner","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"}],"github":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN","copyright":"2024","numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/blob/main/chapters/basics/example.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/edit/main/chapters/basics/example.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"example.md","url":"/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/_public/example-a24e350705dbcc94778f85549cb09958.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这是一个简单、完整并且合理的 ","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"SP5mnHqLRs"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CMakeLists.txt","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"OwYVnpCUmW"},{"type":"text","value":" 的例子。对于这个程序，我们有一个带有头文件与源文件的库文件（ MyLibExample ），以及一个带有源文件的应用程序（ MyExample ）。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"DYSfXhsTsT"}],"key":"QKuglCYSe0"},{"type":"include","file":"../../examples/simple-project/CMakeLists.txt","literal":true,"filter":{"startAfter":"[main]","endBefore":"[main]"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"\n# 几乎所有的 CMake 文件都应该以这行开头\n# 你应当始终指定一个包含已测试的最新和最旧 CMake 版本的范围。\n# 这能确保你启用最佳的 CMake 策略（policy）。\ncmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.15...4.4)\n\n# 这是你的项目声明。你应当始终列出所使用的编程语言；\n# 在这里列出版本号也很不错，因为它会自动设置许多实用的变量\nproject(\n  ModernCMakeExample\n  VERSION 1.0\n  LANGUAGES CXX)\n\n# 如果你要设置任何 CMAKE_ 变量，可以放在这里。\n# （但通常不建议这样做，或许设置 C++ 标准时除外）\n\n# 查找包（find_package）的语句放在这里。\n\n# 通常你应该把后续内容拆分到各个子文件夹中，不过这只是一个简单示例\n\n# 这是一个“默认”类型的库，会匹配相应的变量（BUILD_SHARED_LIBS）设置。\n# 其他常见选项还有 STATIC、SHARED 和 MODULE\n# 在这里把头文件一并列出有助于 IDE 识别，但并非必需。\n# 输出的库文件名与目标名一致，并带有当前系统上的常规扩展名\nadd_library(MyLibExample simple_lib.cpp simple_lib.hpp)\n\n# 将各个目标与其他目标进行链接，或添加编译选项等。\n\n# 添加一个可运行的程序 —— 输出文件名与目标名一致\nadd_executable(MyExample simple_example.cpp)\n\n# 请确保使用此命令来链接你的目标。它也可以链接库甚至编译标志，\n# 因此链接一个不存在的目标不会在配置阶段报错。\ntarget_link_libraries(MyExample PRIVATE MyLibExample)\n","lang":"cmake","filename":"CMakeLists.txt","key":"hM0DbUxqYm"}],"key":"bUlWgNeg6t"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"完整的例子可以在此查看 ","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"VbotTEC3vB"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/tree/master/examples/simple-project","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"examples folder","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"IFsw0B5DIu"}],"urlSource":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/tree/master/examples/simple-project","error":true,"key":"lRoZwBXk4H"},{"type":"text","value":".","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"agWgypHWBa"}],"key":"h3jza5GmiB"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一个更大，并且包含多文件的例子可在此查看 ","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"Ue0ZBBEaaw"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/tree/master/examples/extended-project","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"also available","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,